!
! An answer's confidence (tributary_rules.h TB4), in Trebago: the models
! that agree with it over the models asked, as an exact percent, 100 *
! agree / asked, a reduced rational, never rounded (2 of 3 is 200/3).
! agree is 0..asked and asked 1..999999999: ok is 1 inside and 0 outside,
! and the answer is divided by it, so anything else is a division by zero,
! refused.
trebago answer_confidence
  in  agree(n), asked(n)
  out pct(n)
  var ok(n)
  ok(i) = min(1, max(0, agree(i) + 1)) * min(1, max(0, asked(i) - agree(i) + 1)) &
        * min(1, max(0, asked(i))) * min(1, max(0, 1000000000 - asked(i)))
  pct(i) = 100 * agree(i) / asked(i) / ok(i)
end
